वैशस a. murderous, pernicious;
 n. murder, slaughter,
war, destruction, horrible deed.

1 वै॑श्य m. आ f. a man & woman of the third caste;
 n.
वै॑श्य condition of a V., dependence.

वै॑षुवत a. being in the middle (of the year etc.),
central;
 n. centre.

वैष्णव॑ f. ई॑ belonging or devoted to Viṣṇu;
 m. a
worshipper of Viṣṇu (f. ई), n. E. of a lunar mansion.
